<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Thursday 102,000 -USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Thursday 102,000 -USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual interior Iowa/southern Minnesota hog receipts Thursday were 102,000 head, compared with the estimate of 105,000, USDA said.</p>
<p>Opening trade was not well established. Early sales barrows and gilts were steady to firm than midsession Thursday.</p>
